@School.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5282

### Health check
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Register
POST {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@school.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Me (usa o token do login acima)
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Courses (autenticado)
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Lessons de uma disciplina (substitui o GUID)
GET {{School.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subjects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
